Package: gut-bot
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Gut <https://github.com/valteryde/gut>
Section: net
Priority: optional
Depends: @DEPS@
Description: Self-hosted AI desktop agent backend
 A headless Linux desktop (Xvfb + XFCE4 + Chromium + LibreOffice) governed by
 a vision-enabled agent, streamed over noVNC. Ships the agent daemon
 (REST + WebSocket on :8000), the desktop stream (:6080) and a LiteLLM proxy
 (:4000, localhost-only) with Postgres-backed spend tracking.
 .
 After install, `gut-bot info` prints the address and generated password;
 point the Gut desktop app at it as a device.
Homepage: https://github.com/valteryde/gut
